#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:1
msgid "上位机连接与串口调试"
msgstr "Host PC Connection and Serial Debugging"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:6
msgid ""
"完成 D20、D13 的通用 UART 连接，并使用 **NavStarTool、串口控制台或 Linux 命令"
"**确认定位数据持续输出。接线前先确认[D20 接口](d20-wiring.md)或[D13 接口]"
"(d13-wiring.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Complete the universal UART connection for D20 and D13, and use "
"**NavStarTool, serial console, or Linux commands** to verify continuous "
"output of positioning data. Before wiring, first confirm the [D20 interface]"
"(d20-wiring.md) or [D13 interface](d13-wiring.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:9
msgid "串口参数"
msgstr "Serial port parameters"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "波特率"
msgstr "Baud rate"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "115200 bps"
msgstr "115200 bps"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "数据位"
msgstr "Data bit"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "停止位"
msgstr "Stop bit"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "校验"
msgstr "Verification"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "None"
msgstr "None"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:3
msgid "流控"
msgstr "Flow control"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:19
msgid ""
"D20、D13 均标配 USB 转 UART 转接器，转接器与设备外部 UART 均使用 3.3 V I/O 电"
"平。若改用目标设备串口，也必须兼容 3.3 V UART I/O，且不能使用 RS232 电气接"
"口。"
msgstr ""
"Every D20 and D13 product includes a USB-to-UART adapter. Both the adapter "
"and the device UART use 3.3 V I/O. Any alternative target-device serial port "
"must also support 3.3 V UART I/O; do not use an RS232 electrical interface."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:22
msgid "连接 NavStarTool"
msgstr "Connect NavStarTool"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:25
msgid ""
"获取 NavStarTool 尚未安装时，可直接[下载 NavStarTool](https://github.com/myrobotproject/RTK_Interface-Description/blob/main/NavStarTool_260703_cust_En.zip)，也可前往{ref}`软件工具下载 <software-tools>`查看全部工具，再返回本节完成连接。"
msgstr ""
"If NavStarTool is not installed, [download NavStarTool](https://github.com/myrobotproject/RTK_Interface-Description/blob/main/NavStarTool_260703_cust_En.zip) directly, or go to {ref}`Software Tools Download <software-tools>` to view all tools, then return to this section to complete the connection."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:28
msgid "完成供电、TX/RX 交叉连接和共地。"
msgstr "Complete power supply, TX/RX cross-connection, and common ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:29
msgid "打开 NavStarTool，选择设备对应串口。"
msgstr ""
"Open NavStarTool and select the serial port corresponding to the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:30
msgid "波特率选择`115200`，点击连接。"
msgstr "Select the baud rate `115200` and click connect."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:31
msgid "确认卫星数、经纬高、轨迹和原始数据持续刷新。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm the number of satellites, latitude, longitude, altitude, trajectory, "
"and continuous refresh of raw data."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:33
msgid "![NavStarTool主界面](../images/navstar-main.png)"
msgstr "![NavStarTool Main Interface](../images/navstar-main.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:33
msgid "NavStarTool主界面"
msgstr "NavStarTool Main Interface"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:35
msgid ""
"使用星空图查看卫星分布、CN0 窗口查看信号强度、轨迹图查看定位变化、NMEA 信息窗"
"口检查输出。UBX 输出使用目标飞控、地面站或其他兼容工具验证。"
msgstr ""
"Use the sky plot for satellite distribution, the CN0 window for signal "
"strength, the trajectory plot for position changes, and the NMEA window for "
"output. Verify UBX output with the target flight controller, ground station, "
"or another compatible tool."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:37
msgid "串口控制台"
msgstr "Serial Console"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:39
msgid "可通过`Receiver -> Console`打开控制台。没有持续数据时，依次检查："
msgstr ""
"You can open the console through `Receiver -> Console`. When there is no "
"continuous data, check the following in order:"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:41
msgid "串口号和波特率。"
msgstr "Serial port number and baud rate."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:42
msgid "TX/RX 是否交叉连接。"
msgstr "Verify that TX and RX are crossed."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:43
msgid "设备和调试器是否共地。"
msgstr "Are the device and the debugger sharing the same ground?"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:44
msgid "供电电压和极性。"
msgstr "Power supply voltage and polarity."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:45
msgid "当前固件是否输出预期协议。"
msgstr "Does the current firmware output the expected protocol?"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:47
msgid "Linux 下确认串口"
msgstr "Confirming the serial port in Linux"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:49
msgid "连接产品标配的 USB 转 UART 转接器后，可使用以下命令确认设备节点："
msgstr ""
"After connecting the supplied USB-to-UART adapter, use the following "
"commands to identify the device node:"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:56
msgid "例如设备节点为`/dev/ttyUSB0`时："
msgstr "For example, when the device node is `/dev/ttyUSB0`:"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:62
msgid "出现持续数据表示串口链路已建立；协议含义和刷新率由出厂固件决定。"
msgstr ""
"Continuous data confirms the serial link. The factory firmware determines "
"the output protocol and update rate."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:64
msgid "串口连接完成判据"
msgstr "Completion criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:67
msgid ""
"目标工具中持续出现定位数据，串口号、`115200` 波特率和输出协议均与当前交付配置"
"一致。"
msgstr ""
"The target tool shows continuous positioning data using the correct serial "
"port, `115200` baud rate, and delivered output protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:70
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:72
msgid ""
"输出协议不符合目标设备要求：查看[固件与输出协议选择](firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The output protocol does not meet the requirements of the target device: see "
"[Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](firmware-output.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:73
msgid ""
"已有数据但未进入固定解：查看[RTK状态与固定解验证](rtk-fixed-validation.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Data exists but has not reached a fixed solution: see [RTK Status and Fixed "
"Solution Validation](rtk-fixed-validation.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/host-tool.md:74
msgid "串口仍无法连接：进入[故障排查](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Serial connection still fails: see [Troubleshooting](../troubleshooting/"
"troubleshooting.md)."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "D20、D13 外部 UART IO 电平为 3.3 V。USB 转 UART 模块或目标设备必须兼容 "
#~ "3.3 V IO 电平，且不能使用 RS232 电气接口。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The external UART IO levels of D20 and D13 are 3.3 V. The USB to UART "
#~ "module or target device must be compatible with 3.3 V IO levels and "
#~ "cannot use RS232 electrical interfaces."
